---
title: "release (LegionLinearVesting)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: onlyCliffEnded
    q_guard --> q_checkCliff: block.timestamp >= cliffEndTimestamp?
    q_checkCliff --> q_revert: cliff not ended - revert CliffNotEnded
    q_checkCliff --> q_calcVested: vestedAmount = _vestingSchedule(totalAllocation, block.timestamp)
    q_calcVested --> q_calcReleasable: releasable = vestedAmount - alreadyReleased
    q_calcReleasable --> q_checkReleasable: releasable > 0?
    q_checkReleasable --> q_noOp: releasable == 0 - nothing to release
    q_checkReleasable --> q_updateReleased: _released += releasable
    q_updateReleased --> q_transfer: safeTransfer(beneficiary, releasable)
    q_transfer --> q_emit: emit ERC20Released(token, releasable)
    q_emit --> [*]: return
    q_revert --> [*]: revert
    q_noOp --> [*]: return

    note right of q_checkCliff
        INV-001: No tokens releasable before cliff period ends
        INV-002: cliffEnd = startTimestamp + cliffDurationSeconds
    end note

    note right of q_calcVested
        INV-003: Linear vesting - vestedAmount = totalAllocation * elapsed / duration
        INV-004: After full duration, 100% vested
    end note
